### 1. Data we collect

**We do not collect your name, email, phone number, or any other
directly-identifying information.** The App has no account system and no
login.

| Data | Purpose | Collected by |
|---|---|---|
| App usage events (run starts/ends, revives, combo milestones, daily challenge plays, ad views, purchases) | Understand which parts of the game are used, tune difficulty/economy | Firebase Analytics (Google) |
| Crash reports and error logs | Fix bugs | Firebase Crashlytics (Google) |
| Advertising identifier (IDFA on iOS, Android Advertising ID on Android) and other device/ad-interaction data | Show ads (revive, double-coins, interstitial), measure ad performance; may be used by our ad partner for personalized advertising if you allow tracking | Google AdMob, and AdMob's own mediated ad networks |
| Purchase receipts | Process the one-time "Remove Ads" purchase and let you restore it on a new device | Apple App Store / Google Play billing |

_Every row above is live in the app today. If a new third-party service
is ever added — starting with the Daily Challenge leaderboard, see §0.1 —
add a row here once it actually ships._

### 2. Data stored only on your device

Your coin balance, best score/combo/survival time, unlocked trail
palettes, daily streak, quest progress, and settings (sound/haptics) are
stored locally on your device only. This data is not sent to us and is
deleted if you uninstall the App. There is currently no cloud save or
cross-device sync, and no global leaderboard (Daily Challenge shows only
your own best/attempts locally, not a percentile ranking against other
players).

### 3. Advertising and tracking

The App shows ads (an interstitial after a run, and optional "watch a
video" ads you choose to view in exchange for a revive or doubled coins)
served through **Google AdMob**. AdMob may work with third-party ad
networks that set their own cookies or device identifiers.

**On iOS**, the App shows Apple's App Tracking Transparency prompt (after
your first few runs) and asks your permission before using the
advertising identifier for personalized ads. If you decline, you'll still
see ads, just not ones personalized to your interests.

**On Android**, ads may use the Android Advertising ID unless you've
opted out of ad personalization in your device's Google Settings.

You can review Google's own privacy practices for AdMob at
https://policies.google.com/technologies/ads.

### 4. In-app purchases

The App offers one purchase, "Remove Ads." Payment is processed entirely
by Apple or Google — we never see or store your payment card details.

### 5. Children's privacy

The App is a general-audience casual arcade game and is not directed at
children under 13 (or the relevant age of consent in your country). We do
not knowingly collect personal information from children. [If you intend
to market this app toward children, or expect a substantial child
audience, you must revisit this section together with Google Play's
Families Policy and the FTC's COPPA rule — that changes what ad
personalization and analytics are allowed and is out of scope of this
draft.]

### 6. Data retention and deletion

Analytics and crash data are retained by Firebase per Google's standard
retention settings. Since the App has no account system, there's no
"delete my account" action — uninstalling the App removes all
locally-stored data, and you can request deletion of any analytics data
tied to your device by contacting us at ngochuy2603@gmail.com with your
device's advertising identifier.

### 7. Your choices

- **Ad personalization**: controlled by your OS-level setting (iOS App
  Tracking Transparency, Android "Opt out of Ads Personalization").
- **Remove ads entirely**: the in-app "Remove Ads" purchase removes the
  post-run interstitial (rewarded video, which you opt into per-use for a
  revive or doubled coins, stays available since it's your choice, not an
  interruption).

### 8. Changes to this policy

We may update this policy as the App changes. Material changes will be
reflected by updating the effective date above.

